# Research (docs/re-field-hud.md): does the crystal (HUD button 1) react to a nearby enemy? Logs every
# write to its animation byte while an enemy symbol is moved close to Jian (needs hud_restock)
load hud_restock
trace 0x020B7F71 btn1_anim
trace 0x020B7F70 btn1_bank
wait 300
shot c_far
dump 0x020B7F64 0x30 btn1
poke u32 0x020B70D8 0x1A0000
poke u32 0x020B70DC 0x180000
wait 3
shot c_mid
poke u32 0x020B70D8 0x200000
poke u32 0x020B70DC 0x1C0000
wait 3
shot c_near
dump 0x020B7F64 0x30 btn1_near
wait 30
shot c_after
